Buttons w aplikacji InfoMapper
1. Przyciski Add, Expand, Collapse, Table, Details - przyciski akcji, dodania
Format odniesienia:
<button class="text-xs px-2 py-0.5 bg-blue-500 text-white rounded hover:bg-blue-600 transition-colors">Add</button>

2. Przycski Delete, Remove, etc.
<button class="text-xs px-2 py-0.5 bg-red-500 text-white rounded hover:bg-red-600 transition-colors">Delete</button>

3. Przycski Save
<button class="text-xs px-2 py-0.5 bg-green-500 text-white rounded hover:bg-green-600 transition-colors">Save</button>

3. Przycski Cancel
<button class="text-xs px-2 py-0.5 bg-white-500 text-black rounded hover:bg-white-600 transition-colors">Cancel</button>

4. Collapse / Uncollapse
<button class="text-xs text-gray-500 hover:text-gray-700 hover:bg-gray-100 px-2 py-1 rounded transition-colors" title="Collapse">▼</button>
<button class="text-xs text-gray-500 hover:text-gray-700 hover:bg-gray-100 px-2 py-1 rounded transition-colors" title="Expand">▶</button>